# Files shared in from another app (Android: ACTION_SEND of a photo through the app's own provider, as a gallery shares
# one; macOS: MBUI_SHARE_FILES, a photo and a PDF): the sheet heads with them (the picture's tile), 发到 the chats; the
# test chat tapped: they are in its composer, going up at once as ＋'s files do; sent with words.
#before android-stage e2e-photo.jpg
#android-intent -a android.intent.action.SEND -t image/jpeg --eu android.intent.extra.STREAM content://{PKG}.shared/e2e-photo.jpg
#env MBUI_SHARE_FILES={FILES}/e2e-photo.jpg|{FILES}/e2e-doc.pdf
timeout 60000
until 发到
until e2e-photo.jpg
until 新 chat
wait 1000
shot 1-sheet
tap 端到端测试
until 发消息
wait 1500
shot 2-composer
tap 发消息
type 分享进来的文件 {T}
timeout 120000
until icon:arrow-up
wait 3000
tap icon:arrow-up
empty
gone 正在发送
until 分享进来的文件 {T}
wait 1000
shot 3-sent
